   _Saveframe_category      entry_information

   _Entry_title            
;
Structure of the N-terminal domain of human cardiac troponin C bound to calcium ion and to the inhibitor W7
;
   _BMRB_accession_number   16190
   _BMRB_flat_file_name     bmr16190.str
   _Entry_type              new
   _Submission_date         2009-02-28
   _Accession_date          2009-02-28
   _Entry_origination       author
   _NMR_STAR_version        2.1.1
   _Experimental_method     NMR
   _Details                
;
Structure of the N-terminal domain of human cardiac troponin C bound to the
inhibitor W7 determined through isotopically edited and filtered transferred
NOEs. This is based on the initial coordinates of 1LXF, the intraprotein
conformational restraints of 1MXL, and target geometries for a calcium-binding
loop. The amine moiety of W7 is charged in this structure determination.
;

